WEBVTT

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:04.750
<i>The idea of living my life dressed the same
as someone else makes me shiver.</i>

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:09.130
<i>A herd of sheep, all dressed alike,
will only become food for wolves and tigers.</i>

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:11.840
<i>I will not become one of the sheep.</i>

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:17.510
<i>I'll become a wolf, and instead of being eaten,
I'll be one who does the eating.</i>

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:19.310
Damn it!

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:38.990
<i>Even if that meant going to 
the other world and invading it...</i>

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:53.470
I will plunder.

00:00:54.550 --> 00:01:01.220
I will steal the future... a tomorrow
where all of my comrades can eat until they're full.

00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:07.110
Ready to go?

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:14.320
<i>That's right.</i>

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:20.700
<i>No matter how dirty our hands get,
we need the future.</i>

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:04.010
Showdown: At the End of Time

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:07.560
A hundred years, huh...

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:15.860
Looking at the spacetime waves,
I'm sure our Frontier selves are here, too.

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:18.700
Each of you, spread out and deal with them!

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:50.690
Is that you, Tohru Kazasumi? Stop it!

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:52.650
"Stop it," you say?

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:56.400
There's a huge treasure floating right in front of me.

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:58.610
What reason do I have not to fight?

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:23.090
This has nothing to do with the Timekeepers.

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:27.060
We, from Frontier S, will take
the Energy Cubes from you...

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:28.560
...and steal your future!

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:33.060
What's wrong with you?
Take up your weapons!

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:36.360
No matter how easy you had it growing up, you're still me, right?

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:44.530
Looks like it's begun.

00:04:45.740 --> 00:04:46.910
Let's hurry!

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:53.210
What I want, I grab with my own hands!

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:55.580
What stands in my way,
I'll shoot with my guns!

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:57.960
Aren't those the rules of this world?

00:04:58.590 --> 00:05:01.800
Aren't you mistaken about what you're
 supposed to shoot, Tohru Kazasumi?

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:03.220
What was that?

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:05.720
Our enemy is supposed to be the Timekeepers.

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:09.600
He just keeps running around...

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:19.360
A smokescreen? What's the meaning of this?

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:23.190
I'll go take a look.

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:36.540
Seriously, are you even going to fight for real?

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:39.920
Don't get me wrong.

00:05:40.170 --> 00:05:43.420
The ceasefire from before
was just so we could survive.

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:46.630
We're forced to fight each other
because of the Timekeepers

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:50.100
so that we create the future where they,
the Dead End, are born.

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:51.180
That's right.

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:54.810
That's why, with that Cube,
we're going to rid ourselves of the Timekeepers.

00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:56.520
But we can't win that way.

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:57.190
What?

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:01.610
I have a plan.

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:04.690
It should be a lot more effective
than blindly fighting each other.

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:06.400
What nonsense.

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:10.660
<i>Tohru, we have an emergency!</i>

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:24.590
<i>An unknown time dome has been created.
A spacetime storm is coming!</i>

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:27.260
Is this your doing?

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:30.430
We used our Energy Cube to surround Shibuya.

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:35.140
The interference waves of the time dome
are activating that giant Energy Cube.

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:38.770
I see. So this was what you were after
from the beginning.

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:53.830
That gate leads to the temporal axis
where the Timekeepers are located.

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:55.790
But we still don't have enough.

00:06:57.500 --> 00:07:01.080
What we're currently using
is the Energy Cube from our world.

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:04.170
Without using the Cube
from your world as well,

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:07.090
we can't pass through the gate
to the Timekeepers' temporal axis.

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:09.720
You want me to entrust our Cube to you?

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:14.720
How do I know you won't eradicate all
of us immediately afterwards?

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:15.810
I understand.

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:20.350
That's why we'll entrust you with
control of the Energy Cubes.

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:22.060
Are you serious?

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:28.110
This battle only has two endings:
either we win, or the Dead End wins.

00:07:28.490 --> 00:07:32.120
Are you saying that you'd give up
if we refuse to cooperate with you?

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:33.280
No.

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:38.120
In that case, we'll kill you all so we can
procure the Cube and open the gate.

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:40.120
But we don't want to do that.

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:56.770
Fine. But there's no need
to give us control.

00:07:57.020 --> 00:08:02.310
We force our Cubes to resonate and crash into their place. That's enough.

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:03.810
I won't owe you anything.

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:07.730
What's so funny?

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:11.280
No, I thought that's what you'd say...

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:13.070
Shut up.

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:18.910
<i>Field creation confirmed.</i>

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:21.540
<i>Tachyons are stable.
Catching psyche waves.</i>

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:23.040
<i>Boson values increasing.</i>

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:27.800
To think we'd team up with you guys again.

00:08:28.050 --> 00:08:31.680
We've always decided our own destinies ourselves.

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:32.970
That's all.

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:34.590
Yeah.

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:43.520
Trapping weak bosons and gluons.

00:08:43.690 --> 00:08:46.020
Confirmed 97% congruency
with theoretical values.

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:47.900
OK, you're good to go.

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:59.240
<i>Are you ready?</i>

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:03.210
It's all we can do
to send the two of you through this gate.

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:06.130
If you can send the two of us,
that's good enough.

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:09.670
Let's go. Lend me your strength.

00:09:11.510 --> 00:09:13.630
Yeah, I don't think you could handle this alone.

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:48.210
Damn it!

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:10.480
Why must you resist so strongly?

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:16.820
In the end, the two worlds will be lead to destruction via the war.

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:18.660
Those are your words!

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:26.040
Humans die in due time.

00:10:34.010 --> 00:10:36.090
We control all time.

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:44.220
There is no life, there is no death.
We release humankind from all pain.

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:50.560
So you want us to live
in a convenient lie?

00:10:50.770 --> 00:10:53.610
That's what's necessary for man to evolve.

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:04.660
No matter the era,
the scenery is unchanging.

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:11.460
The sins that humans create.

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:16.380
The point where it gets decided.
A war where a world fights another world.

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:19.470
Destiny can never be changed.

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:20.680
That's why...

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:45.330
This is...

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:58.340
Kenji! Kenji! You can't die!

00:12:06.560 --> 00:12:08.680
That is your past self.

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:14.690
You couldn't protect anyone.
Violence never resolved anything.

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:17.690
That's not true. I...

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:20.110
Why didn't you save me?

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:23.740
Remy?

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:31.330
I died... but on their side,
I'm still alive. Why?

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:44.840
I wanted to protect all of you...

00:12:49.640 --> 00:12:51.690
But you couldn't protect them.

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:20.760
Humans continue to live
in a cycle of death and destruction.

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:23.090
Guns can't change anything.

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:27.510
It merely creates an infinite chain
of hatred and retribution.

00:13:28.050 --> 00:13:30.720
That's why I'm going to
seize that Energy Cube.

00:13:30.720 --> 00:13:34.190
With that power,
I won't repeat the same mistakes.

00:13:35.270 --> 00:13:36.350
Mistakes?

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:38.520
That's right.

00:13:38.820 --> 00:13:41.400
I'll never lose someone dear to me again.

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:44.900
That's the mistake that my past self made
due to his weakness.

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:49.240
But if you accept the Dead End,

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:53.620
my death, and everyone else's,
will never have happened!

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:56.790
If you want to atone for your mistake,
isn't that what you should do?

00:13:57.540 --> 00:13:59.170
Don't say it's disgusting!

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:01.960
You want it too, don't you?
My sweet candy.

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:04.340
But too bad, this one is for my dear sister.

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:07.760
No, that's not it, Remy!

00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:14.430
You died. The people that died
all stay alive within my heart.

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:16.940
That's just a delusion.

00:14:16.940 --> 00:14:18.310
That's right.

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:22.440
And this world of the Dead End must be nothing more
than a well-constructed delusion too!

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:37.790
It doesn't look like
you're one of the Timekeepers.

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:39.790
Right.

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:47.970
Go.

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:52.100
You should settle the score with them.

00:14:52.470 --> 00:14:58.140
All of the temporal energy is collected in your Cube.
Drive that thing in.

00:14:58.350 --> 00:14:59.100
Got it.

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:05.780
That's enough.

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:20.250
Bring it! I'll take all of you on!

00:15:24.710 --> 00:15:27.300
Why must you resist so firmly?

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:30.550
Our desires should be the same.

00:15:32.100 --> 00:15:35.430
We want to save humans
from pain and sadness...

00:15:35.430 --> 00:15:37.060
That may be true!

00:15:37.310 --> 00:15:40.310
But that's a world
where you decide how we live!

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:44.900
A world where only the things we can already imagine will happen!

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:49.780
Isn't that exactly what goes on
in the Management District you live in?

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:50.780
It isn't!

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:54.830
I've met many people
and learned about many things.

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:58.870
That's how our world keeps expanding!

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:07.840
Pain, suffering, sadness...

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:11.970
We all accept it,
and that's why we can move forward!

00:16:20.440 --> 00:16:22.810
We fail. We make mistakes.

00:16:23.150 --> 00:16:26.070
But each time we do,
I think we become stronger.

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:36.700
That's why I— <i>we</i> will defeat you
and seize our future.

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:41.410
We don't care if we get hurt.
We'll seize a future where we can live as humans!

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:45.250
However, unless you can pinpoint the
temporal axis where we're located,

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:47.880
you can't make any attacks against us.

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:49.460
We'll see about that.

00:16:53.390 --> 00:16:55.100
A boson increase!

00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:58.770
I've confirmed the entrapment of the temporal axis
where the Timekeepers are located!

00:16:58.770 --> 00:17:00.680
Synchronizing the temporal axes of both worlds.

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:04.020
Quantum entanglement, okay!
System booting!

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:13.860
Impossible! Are you directly interfering
with our temporal axis?

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:18.330
Both we and they have been
investigating you for a long time.

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:21.910
And back when you
meddled with me,

00:17:22.410 --> 00:17:25.750
we discovered that our Cube
was linked to your temporal axis.

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:32.260
Impossible! You had the potential to develop such a technology from such limited information!?

00:17:39.680 --> 00:17:41.560
You were rushing too much.

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:44.100
Me... rushing?

00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:48.190
You feared us.
You feared the possibility of the unknown.

00:17:48.690 --> 00:17:52.610
We've surpassed your expectations, Timekeeper!

00:17:58.370 --> 00:17:59.830
Go!

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:06.290
Do you know what it is
you're doing right now?

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.340
We know.

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:14.630
It's something stupid.

00:18:15.470 --> 00:18:17.550
They don't teach us this at school.

00:18:20.760 --> 00:18:22.930
I don't even know if this is the right answer.

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:29.940
We're doing something stupid!

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:39.780
You must reconsider.

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:43.540
It's possible your actions will become
a singularity on the timeline.

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:50.040
All futures will lose wave function convergence
and become an unpredictable fog.

00:18:50.290 --> 00:18:54.420
That's fine. Nobody can predict the future!

00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:58.090
That's why there's despair, but there's also hope!

00:18:58.510 --> 00:19:00.470
This is the last of the energy!

00:19:11.820 --> 00:19:15.490
That can't be... it's not enough
even though we've come this far?

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:20.950
It looks like you miscalculated!

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:25.830
You guys failed to draw out one last
little bit of power from the Energy Cube!

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:30.920
The quantum entanglement convergence is dropping!

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:32.750
I can't fully contain the Timekeepers!

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:35.760
Damn it! What the hell is Tohru doing?

00:19:36.090 --> 00:19:38.880
That is the limit of
hastily prepared technology.

00:19:39.180 --> 00:19:42.300
The resonation phenomenon
from the fields is now ending.

00:19:42.470 --> 00:19:45.640
You will both disappear
along with this spacetime.

00:19:45.850 --> 00:19:46.980
We'll see about that!

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:52.980
You're...

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:54.980
That's impossible!

00:19:58.610 --> 00:20:00.990
"You should be dead!", right?

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:05.540
I will survive.

00:20:05.740 --> 00:20:07.910
If I lose to your shallow dream,

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:10.670
then I won't be able
to face those that have died.

00:20:18.090 --> 00:20:19.300
Timekeeper!

00:20:20.340 --> 00:20:21.680
I'm relieved.

00:20:22.840 --> 00:20:25.430
You weren't an omnipotent god at all.

00:20:28.180 --> 00:20:31.270
You're merely human, just like us!

00:20:32.810 --> 00:20:34.730
No!

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:54.040
Thank you for protecting the future.

00:20:55.130 --> 00:20:56.920
Oh... yeah.

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:27.200
I guess we made it back.

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:28.330
Yeah.

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:36.380
Now, let's begin.
It's time for the final showdown.

00:21:36.670 --> 00:21:42.170
Stop it. If we use the powers of the Cube,
that will call on the Dead End once again.

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:45.430
Technology is a human creation.

00:21:45.430 --> 00:21:48.640
I'll control it without fail
and seize hold of our future.

00:21:50.930 --> 00:21:54.350
Then I'll be the one to stop you.

00:23:25.650 --> 00:23:27.240
Victory feels so fruitless.

00:23:27.740 --> 00:23:28.950
Th-That's...

00:23:28.950 --> 00:23:30.740
A loop-bomb that rewinds everything!

00:23:30.740 --> 00:23:31.830
Are you serious?

00:23:31.830 --> 00:23:33.870
A loop is the ultimate way
of keeping the status quo!

00:23:33.870 --> 00:23:35.500
That's the ideal negativity!

00:23:36.160 --> 00:23:37.520
Next episode: "Encounter."

00:23:36.160 --> 00:23:40.040
<b><i>ENCOUNTER </i></b>OUR FUTURE

00:23:37.520 --> 00:23:38.430
"Our Future."

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:40.040
Thanks for everything.
